{"product_id":"the-work-we-were-born-to-do-find-the-work-you-love-love-the-work-you-do","title":"The Work We Were Born to Do: Find the Work You Love, Love the Work You Do","description":"\u003cp\u003eWould you like a more fulfilling work life? Do you want a job that's creative, exciting and rewarding? That allows you to be who you truly are? You need to discover the work you were born to do. Leading work-expert Nick Williams has identified the twelve principles of the work we were born to do. He show how we can activate these principles to amazing effect and utilize our inner power at whatever stage we have reached in our working lives. The Work We Were Born To Do shows how to discover your purpose and reveals how to make money following your heart's desire. It will help undo any conditioning that has held you back, exploring ways to build work from the inside out, using heart, spirit, essence and inspiration. The work you were born to do is your birthright, lay claim to it now!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 159 x 241\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Nick Williams\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781862045521\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 381\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45169636966553,"sku":"3RE9781862045521","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67b9aa6b208f8_The_20Work_20We_20Were_20Born_20to_20Do-_20Find_20the_20Work_20You_20Love_20Love_20the_20Work_20You_20Do_20Nick_20Williams.jpg?v=1740232444","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-work-we-were-born-to-do-find-the-work-you-love-love-the-work-you-do","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}